{"singlePage": [], "startSite": "", "filingNum": "", "onePageListNum": 15, "commentLabelColor": "#006b75", "yearColorList": ["#bc4c00", "#0969da", "#1f883d", "#A333D0"], "i18n": "CN", "themeMode": "manual", "dayTheme": "light", "nightTheme": "dark", "urlMode": "pinyin", "script": "", "style": "", "head": "", "indexScript": "", "indexStyle": "", "bottomText": "", "showPostSource": 1, "iconList": {}, "UTC": 8, "rssSplit": "sentence", "exlink": {}, "needComment": 1, "allHead": "<script src='https://blog.meekdai.com/Gmeek/plugins/GmeekBSZ.js'></script>", "title": "\u6797\u541b\u6d69", "subTitle": "\u4e2a\u4eba\u535a\u5ba2", "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/358701160?v=4&size=64", "GMEEK_VERSION": "last", "postListJson": {"P2": {"htmlDir": "docs/post/qiu-qi-shu-he.html", "labels": ["documentation"], "postTitle": "\u6c42\u5947\u6570\u548c", "postUrl": "post/qiu-qi-shu-he.html", "postSourceUrl": "https://github.com/lin017835-pixel/lin017835.github.io/issues/2", "commentNum": 0, "wordCount": 343, "description": "# \u6c42\u5947\u6570\u548c\n\u5b8c\u6574\u4ee3\u7801\n```c\n#include<stdio.h>\nint main()\n{\n\tint n,sum = 0;\n\tscanf('%d',&n);\n\twhile(n > 0)\n\t{\n\t\t\n\t\t\tif(n % 2 != 0)//\u5224\u65ad\u662f\u5426\u4e3a\u5947\u6570 \n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tsum = sum + n;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tscanf('%d',&n);//\u7ee7\u7eed\u8f93\u5165\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u6570\u5b57\n\t\t\n\t}\n\tprintf('%d',s);\n\treturn 0;\n}\n \n```\n##  \u603b\u7ed3\n## \u7528\u8f93\u5165\u7684\u6570\u662f\u5426\u80fd\u88ab2\u6574\u9664\u6765\u5224\u65ad\u662f\u5426\u4e3a\u5947\u6570 \ud83d\ude04 :\n```c \n       if(n % 2 != 0)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tsum = sum + n;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tscanf('%d',&n)```\n\u3002", "top": 0, "createdAt": 1795246534, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "ogImage": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/358701160?v=4&size=64", "createdDate": "2026-11-21", "dateLabelColor": "#1f883d"}, "P3": {"htmlDir": "docs/post/qiu-zheng-shu-wei-shu-ji-ge-wei-shu-zi-zhi-he.html", "labels": ["documentation"], "postTitle": "\u6c42\u6574\u6570\u4f4d\u6570\u53ca\u5404\u4f4d\u6570\u5b57\u4e4b\u548c", "postUrl": "post/qiu-zheng-shu-wei-shu-ji-ge-wei-shu-zi-zhi-he.html", "postSourceUrl": "https://github.com/lin017835-pixel/lin017835.github.io/issues/3", "commentNum": 0, "wordCount": 356, "description": "# \u6c42\u6574\u6570\u4f4d\u6570\u53ca\u5404\u4f4d\u6570\u5b57\u4e4b\u548c \ud83d\ude38 :\n## \u5b8c\u6574\u4ee3\u7801 \n```c\n#include<stdio.h>\nint main()\n{\n\tint n,weishu,sum = 0;\n\tscanf('%d',&n);\n\twhile(n > 0)\n\t{\n\t\tsum = sum + n % 10;\n\t\tn = n / 10;\n\t\tweishu = weishu + 1;\n\t}\n\tprintf('%d %d',weishu,sum);\n\treturn 0;\n}\n```\n\n#  \u603b\u7ed3 \uff1a\n\n\n\n## \u6280\u5de7\n### `sum = sum + n % 10`\u7528\u6765\u6c42\u4e2a\u4f4d\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\u6570\n### \u5f97\u5230\u4e2a\u4f4d\u6570\u4e4b\u540e\u628a\u4e2a\u4f4d\u6570\u52a0\u8fdbsum\u91cc\uff0c\u7136\u540e\u518d\u7528`n = n / 10`\u5c06\u4e2a\u4f4d\u6570\u53bb\u9664\uff0c\u6700\u540e`weishu = weishu + 1` \u8bb0\u5f55\u4f4d\u6570\n\n\u3002", "top": 0, "createdAt": 1795249791, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "ogImage": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/358701160?v=4&size=64", "createdDate": "2026-11-21", "dateLabelColor": "#1f883d"}, "P4": {"htmlDir": "docs/post/cha-zhao-zui-xiao-zhi.html", "labels": ["\u4f5c\u4e1a"], "postTitle": "\u67e5\u627e\u6700\u5c0f\u503c", "postUrl": "post/cha-zhao-zui-xiao-zhi.html", "postSourceUrl": "https://github.com/lin017835-pixel/lin017835.github.io/issues/4", "commentNum": 0, "wordCount": 477, "description": "# C\u8bed\u8a00\u4e2d\u7684\u6700\u5c0f\u503c\u67e5\u627e \ud83d\udc30 \n\n```c\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void)\n{\n    int n;\n    int num1;\n    int MIN;\n\n    scanf('%d', &n);\n    scanf('%d', &num1);\n\n    /* \u5c06\u7b2c\u4e00\u4e2a\u6570\u5b57\u4f5c\u4e3a\u5f53\u524d\u7684\u6700\u5c0f\u503c */\n    MIN = num1;\n\n    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++)\n    {\n        /* \u6bcf\u6b21\u8bfb\u53d6\u540e\u7acb\u5373\u8fdb\u884c\u6bd4\u8f83 */\n        if (num1 < MIN)\n        {\n            MIN = num1;\n        }\n\n        scanf('%d', &num1);\n    }\n\n    printf('min = %d', MIN);\n\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n# \u603b\u7ed3\n> ## \u5728\u4ee3\u7801\u4e2d\uff0c\u6211\u5c06\u6700\u5f00\u59cb\u7684num1\u5b58\u5165\u5728MIN\u91cc\uff0c\u63a5\u7740\u66f4\u65b0num1\u7684\u503c\uff0c\u518d\u5c06\u8ddf\u65b0\u540e\u7684num1\u7684\u503c\u548cMIN\u6bd4\u8f83\uff0c\u82e5\u6bd4MIN\u5c0f\u5c31\u53d6\u4ee3\uff01\u3002", "top": 0, "createdAt": 1795273039, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "ogImage": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/358701160?v=4&size=64", "createdDate": "2026-11-21", "dateLabelColor": "#1f883d"}, "P5": {"htmlDir": "docs/post/shu-zi-jin-zi-ta.html", "labels": ["\u4f5c\u4e1a"], "postTitle": "\u6570\u5b57\u91d1\u5b57\u5854", "postUrl": "post/shu-zi-jin-zi-ta.html", "postSourceUrl": "https://github.com/lin017835-pixel/lin017835.github.io/issues/5", "commentNum": 0, "wordCount": 275, "description": "# \u6570\u5b57\u91d1\u5b57\u5854\n## \u5b9e\u73b0\u4ee3\u7801\n```c\n#include<stdio.h>\nint main()\n{\n\tint i,j,n;\n\tscanf('%d',&n);\n\tfor(i = 0 ; i <= n ; i = i + 1)\n\t{\n\t\tfor(j = 0 ; j < n - i ; j = j + 1)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tprintf(' ');\n\t\t}\n\t\tfor(j = 0 ; j < i ; j = j + 1)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tprintf('%2d',i);\n\t\t}\n\t\tprintf('\\n');\n\t}\n\treturn 0;\n}\n```\n\u3002", "top": 0, "createdAt": 1795414645, "style": "", "script": "", "head": "", "ogImage": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/358701160?v=4&size=64", "createdDate": "2026-11-23", "dateLabelColor": "#1f883d"}}, "singeListJson": {}, "labelColorDict": {"accessibility": "#f143ab", "bug": "#d73a4a", "documentation": "#0075ca", "duplicate": "#cfd3d7", "enhancement": "#a2eeef", "good first issue": "#7057ff", "help wanted": "#008672", "invalid": "#e4e669", "question": "#d876e3", "wontfix": "#ffffff", "\u4f5c\u4e1a": "#905429", "\u5b66\u6821\u4f5c\u4e1a": "#a3767a"}, "displayTitle": "\u6797\u541b\u6d69", "faviconUrl": "https: